ind":"update","title":"Next Fest Demo Update!","summary":"It’s finally here: the Cash is King! Next Fest Demo Update is live! There’s a ton of new stuff to discover in this version. Alongside fresh business opportunities, you can now experience the automation of Cash is King! for the first time by hiring your first worker. But that’s not all. We’ve also polished the balancing and general gameplay. Once your popularity is above 10, Rico now pays you for sweeping away dirt, and begging earns you more money too, depending on your popularity. You can also ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-16T12:06:52Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706681216","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:57:30Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4140700-1842846814443151","game_id":"steam-4140700","kind":"announcement","title":"Release on November 5th, 2026!","summary":"Important Announcement from Lenny! The release date for Cash is King! is set! On November 5th, 2026, the full version will be released.In the full version, you’ll not only meet new characters, but you’ll also have many more ways to get closer to your goal of becoming rich. Thank You to Our Community!A huge thank you to our amazing community, who has been supporting us with great ideas ever since the very first Cash is King! demo. Our list of things we still want to add to the game is truly massi","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-03T12:36:30Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814443151","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:57:30Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4140700-1840944183776679","game_id":"steam-4140700","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update 0.3 is live!","summary":"Hello, friends of the sun!Since the release of the very first Cash is King! demo, a lot has changed in Miami.You played, laughed, begged, and sent us tons of feedback. And as promised, we packed a whole bunch of new stuff into Demo Update 0.3. Expect new locations, new mechanics, new quests, and a whole lot of chaos.New Locations: Bob & Billy open their doorsTwo new hotspots are waiting for you:Bob’s Plant Shop: Green stuff, butterflies, and a cage you probably shouldn’t open.Billy’s AMAZING Sto","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-13T12:59:50Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183776679","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:57:30Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4140700-1839041357029488","game_id":"steam-4140700","kind":"announcement","title":"Road to demo 0.3","summary":"Dear Miami Money MakersWe’ve got exciting news for you. Right now, we’re working full speed on a brand‑new Cash is King! demo.Version 0.3 will not only bring a range of improvements but also fresh content. Get ready to meet new characters, take on new tasks, and explore new businesses across our version of Miami.To prepare for the launch of the new demo, we will temporarily deactivate the current demo on July 30th. So if you still want to check it out, take the chance to wander through Miami, ea","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-24T12:55:34Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839041357029488","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:57:30Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4140700-1836506165558267","game_id":"steam-4140700","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo recap & next steps!","summary":"Hey everyone!We’ve just wrapped up another week of the Cash is King demo, and we want to take a moment to say thank you. The amount of feedback, bug reports, ideas, and general Miami chaos stories you’ve shared has been incredible. Your input is already shaping the next steps of the game.Demo Stats & Playtime InsightsSo far, 1,558 unique players have tried the demo, which is absolutely wild for us.A few fun numbers from the playtime data:Average playtime: 1h 25min91% of players stayed for at lea","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-28T14:00:15Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165558267","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:57:30Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4140700-1834602721197187","game_id":"steam-4140700","kind":"announcement","title":"Deutsche Indie Showcase Choice Award!","summary":"Hey everyone!We have some exciting news to share: Cash is King! has been selected to be part of the Deutsche Indie Showcase 2026 - a celebration of indie games made in Germany, and we couldn't be more thrilled to be included!Please check out the Deutsche Indie Showcase Steam event: https://store.steampowered.com/publisher/Sidekick/sale/DeutscheIndieShowcaseAs part of the showcase, we premiered a brand-new trailer featuring fresh gameplay footage that gives a closer look at what's coming in Cash ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-07T22:02:58Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1834602721197187","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:57:30Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4140700-1829528821306615","game_id":"steam-4140700","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo Available","summary":"Hey business people!The Cash is King demo is now open to everyone. What have we changed?We’ve resolved several issues from the initial playtest -huge thanks to everyone who shared their feedback. We’re proud of the responses so far and can’t wait to hear your thoughts on the demo. New to Cash is King?Haven’t tried the Cash is King playtest yet? Now’s the perfect time to launch your business in Miami Beach!Roadmap / Release Date?There’s no release date yet, and we’ll be refining our plans based o","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-09T13:03:18Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1829528821306615","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:57:30Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4140700-1828441623106953","game_id":"steam-4140700","kind":"announcement","title":"Playtest ends on Monday!","summary":"The Cash is King playtest is wrapping up soon!We will close on Monday at 3 p.m. (CET). We’re thrilled with all the feedback we’ve received so far and feel lucky to have such a fantastic community. If you haven’t joined in yet, there’s still time this weekend to take your first steps toward building a thriving business in Miami Beach. After the playtest ends, we’ll carefully review all your feedback to plan improvements for the official demo release.In the meantime, enjoy your time at Miami Beach","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-03-28T17:06:20Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1828441623106953","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:57:30Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4140700-1827626365750367","game_id":"steam-4140700","kind":"announcement","title":"Cash is King! Playtest","summary":"We’re excited to introduce our latest game: Cash is King!Sun, sand and money are in the air. You start with empty pockets and work your way up in this chill first-person simulation. Collect cash, improve your reputation and enjoy fun, slightly chaotic gameplay with hustles and funny minigames. In the end, only one thing counts: Cash is King – and you want the crown.The Steam page for Cash is King is now live, and the public playtest kicks off today! Begin your business adventure right here: And ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-03-18T13:57:31Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1827626365750367","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:57:30Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4140700":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T01:46:46Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T01:46:46Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4140700":"2026-10-26T01:46:46Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4140700":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T01:46:46Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T01:46:46Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"4218200":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T01:46:46Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T01:46:46Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4140700","app_id":4140700,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:28Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"7752c6b12183c60a6558701442170e37becafa22b4f75f16d7bd17db5b342f85","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"빈손으로 시작해 햇살 가득한 마이애미 비치에서 나만의 비즈니스 제국을 세워 보세요! 레모네이드를 팔고, 자동판매기를 운영하고, 사업을 자동화하며, 작은 부업을 큰 수익으로 바꿔 보세요. 느긋하게 즐기는 1인칭 시뮬레이터입니다.","publishers":[{"name":"Three River Games (3RG)","creator_clan_account_id":45662935}],"developers":[{"name":"BlackBeak Games","creator_clan_account_id":45627219}],"franchises":[{"name":"Cash is King!"}]},"release":{"steam_release_date":1793887200,"is_coming_soon":true,"coming_soon_display":"date_full"},"trailers":{"highlights":[{"trailer_name":"Release Trailer","trailer_url_format":"steam/apps/${FILENAME}?t=17926575